OL,3,GNEWSA#40m unused road may open - but
OL,4,Anot for everyone
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn unused road that cost #40m to build
OL,7,Fmay be opened to some traffic next
OL,8,Fyear.
OL,10,FThe Southern Connector Road was built
OL,11,Fto link 8,000 new homes near South
OL,12,FMarston in Swindon with the M4, but
OL,13,Fdefects were discovered and it was
OL,14,Fdeemed unsafe.
OL,16,FSwindon Borough Council said it was now
OL,17,Flooking for a contractor to start work
OL,18,Fso the road could open to lorries and
OL,19,Fconstruction traffic.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
