OL,3,GNEWSA#40m unused road may open - but
OL,4,Anot for everyone
OL,5,
OL,6,FCurrently, trucks and lorries involved
OL,7,Fin the housing development are using
OL,8,Flocal residential roads. Plumber Danny
OL,9,FO'Reilly said: "There is loads more
OL,10,Ftraffic in the area, loads of trucks
OL,11,Fand lorries, it's manic."
